Pillow 13.0.0's musllinux wheels, which the Alpine image installs, include
libbsd and libmd from the Alpine system they are built on, because libXdmcp
needs them. Pillow's LICENSE file covers the other libraries in the wheels
but not these. The license files of each are in the directory of the same
name, and the source release of the version in the wheels is listed below.

